Identify whether the following signals are energy signals or power signals. Also, calculate energy and power of the following signals.

 a) $x[n] = \left(\frac{1}{3}\right)^n u[n]$

 b)

$$
x[n] = \begin{cases}
n^2, & 0 \le n \le 3 \\
10-n, & 4 \le n \le 6 \\
0, & \text{otherwise}
\end{cases}
$$

Determine the response of the system described by

$$
y[n]=\frac{1}{3}\{x[n+1]+x[n]+x[n-1]\}
$$

to the input signal,

$$
x[n]=\begin{cases}
3, & -2 \le n \le 2 \\
0, & \text{otherwise}
\end{cases}
$$
